    <statement><p>Consider the path 
    <m>\mathbf{r}(t) = (6 t, 3 t^2, 3\ln t)</m> defined for <m>t &gt; 0</m>.</p>
<p>Find the length of the curve between the points
<m>(6, 3, 0)</m> and <m>(24, 48, 3 \ln(4))</m>.</p>
<p><fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>45+3\ln\mathopen{}\left(4\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
